<div class="container">
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>🕸️ 全域知识图谱</h1>
    <p>实体关系抽取 · 知识关联可视化 · 跨域知识融合 · 从碎片化信息到结构化知识体系</p>
    <div class="hero-anchor">知识就是力量 · 图谱让知识互联</div>
  </div>

  <div class="stats-row">
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">5类</div><div class="stat-label">实体类型</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">5种</div><div class="stat-label">关系类型</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">4个</div><div class="stat-label">向量集合</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">669</div><div class="stat-label">总资产数</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">167</div><div class="stat-label">真值条目</div></div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">🌐 知识图谱可视化</div>
    <div class="graph-container" id="graph">
      <div class="edge" style="left:20%;top:30%;width:20%;transform:rotate(15deg)"></div>
      <div class="edge" style="left:40%;top:30%;width:20%;transform:rotate(-15deg)"></div>
      <div class="edge" style="left:20%;top:60%;width:20%;transform:rotate(-15deg)"></div>
      <div class="edge" style="left:40%;top:60%;width:20%;transform:rotate(15deg)"></div>
      <div class="edge" style="left:30%;top:45%;width:15%;transform:rotate(90deg)"></div>
      <div class="node" style="left:10%;top:20%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#D4AF37,#8B6914)">火斗云智</div>
      <div class="node" style="left:35%;top:15%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8B5CF6,#6D28D9)">ZONGYUAN</div>
      <div class="node" style="left:60%;top:20%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3B82F6,#1D4ED8)">SM-BS流形</div>
      <div class="node" style="left:10%;top:55%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#10B981,#047857)">关键转折点</div>
      <div class="node" style="left:35%;top:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#EF4444,#B91C1C)">CTE闭环</div>
      <div class="node" style="left:60%;top:55%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#F59E0B,#D97706)">七层架构</div>
      <div class="node" style="left:35%;top:75%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#EC4899,#BE185D)">算子化架构</div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:12px;font-size:11px;color:#6b7280">点击节点查看详情 · 知识图谱持续扩展中</div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">🏷️ 五大实体类型</div>
    <div class="grid-4">
      <div class="card"><div class="card-icon">👤</div><div class="card-title">人物实体</div><div class="card-desc">历史人物、神话角色、技术专家、组织成员等人物实体。九天玄女、女娲、烛龙、月神、真武大帝、伏羲等。</div></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="card-icon">📋</div><div class="card-title">事件实体</div><div class="card-desc">历史事件、技术里程碑、产品发布、架构演进等事件实体。从V1.0到V9.11的完整演进历程。</div></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="card-icon">💡</div><div class="card-title">概念实体</div><div class="card-desc">理论概念、技术术语、架构模式、算法模型等概念实体。火斗云智、SM-BS、关键转折点、HLC等。</div></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="card-icon">📦</div><div class="card-title">产品实体</div><div class="card-desc">软件产品、技术服务、API接口、工具平台等产品实体。政务AI、短剧流水线、AIOS、向量库等。</div></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="card-icon">📜</div><div class="card-title">文档实体</div><div class="card-desc">技术白皮书、API文档、研究论文、协议规范等文档实体。20+篇技术白皮书，33+API文档。</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">🔗 五种关系类型</div>
    <div class="grid-4">
      <div class="card"><div class="card-icon">➡️</div><div class="card-title">因果关系</div><div class="card-desc">A导致B，因果链溯源，奇点识别，收敛路径规划。因果分析引擎理论支撑。</div></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="card-icon">📂</div><div class="card-title">从属关系</div><div class="card-desc">A属于B，层级归属，分类体系，组织架构。七层完备架构的层级从属关系。</div></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="card-icon">⏰</div><div class="card-title">时序关系</div><div class="card-desc">A先于B，时间先后，演进历程，版本迭代。V1.0→V9.11完整时间线。</div></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="card-icon">🔄</div><div class="card-title">相似关系</div><div class="card-desc">A相似于B，语义相似度，概念关联，类比推理。2560维语义向量计算。</div></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="card-icon">⚔️</div><div class="card-title">对立关系</div><div class="card-desc">A对立于B，矛盾冲突，阴阳对立，辩证统一。元秩序层与源序层的对立统一。</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
